			"notes": "## Say It v1.0.0\n\nPick up or drop an item and say its name in another language within 15 seconds. Get it right and it's unlocked for good, miss it and it's deleted.\n\n- 10 languages: German, Spanish, French, Italian, Portuguese, Dutch, Polish, Turkish, Russian, Hindi\n- Press **K** for the menu\n- Offline speech recognition (Vosk). Asks before downloading a language's speech model (~30-50 MB)\n\nNeeds Minecraft **1.21.11**, Fabric Loader, Fabric API and a microphone.\n\nDownload `sayit-1.0.0.jar` below."
